  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy so far (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more advanced image encoder) while keeping other components the same, to assess if the stronger image representation further improves performance. This clarifies the impact of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision, and leverages the strong prior evidence for scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation."
}

